      <title>4 things investigators learned about the dysfunction at Trump's Labor Department</title>
      <author>Andrea Hsu</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/09/04/nx-s1-5958601/labor-department-inspector-general-secretary-chavez-deremer</link>
      <comments>https://text.npr.org/2026/09/04/nx-s1-5958601/labor-department-inspector-general-secretary-chavez-deremer</comments>
